OL,3,AEnergy bills to rise by 26% from
OL,4,AJanuary after gas prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA household using a typical amount of
OL,7,Fenergy in England, Scotland and Wales
OL,8,Fand paying by direct debit, would see
OL,9,Ftheir annual bill rise from #1,723 to
OL,10,F#2,166 if the increase was sustained
OL,11,Ffor a year, said regulator Ofgem.
OL,13,FThe government will pay millions of
OL,14,Fhouseholds #100 from 4 January to help
OL,15,Fcover winter costs on top of an
OL,16,Fexisting VAT cut on electricity.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
