OL,3,ATwo men charged with trying to steal
OL,4,Acufflinks and clock from Royal home
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth appeared at Norwich Magistrates'
OL,7,FCourt earlier and have been remanded in
OL,8,Fcustody until a hearing on Monday.
OL,9,FProsecutors said a third suspect
OL,10,Fremained at large.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
